-'       Based on PD's Fading Light System
-' SetLamp 0 is Off
-' SetLamp 1 is On
-' fading for non opacity objects is 4 steps
-'***************************************************
-
-Dim LampState(200), FadingLevel(200)
-Dim FlashSpeedUp(200), FlashSpeedDown(200), FlashMin(200), FlashMax(200), FlashLevel(200)
