-' Put all the Sleeve objects in dSleeves collection. Make sure dSleeves fires hit events.
-Sub dSleeves_Hit(idx)
-  SleevesD.Dampen ActiveBall
-  TargetBouncer ActiveBall, 0.7
-End Sub
